          },
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: fr('Are inflatable SUPs safe for children?', 'Les paddles gonflables sont-ils sûrs pour les enfants ?'),
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: fr(
              'Yes. Inflatable SUPs are actually safer for children than hard boards because they have no sharp edges or hard rails. The soft inflatable construction cushions falls and reduces injury risk. Always pair with a life vest and adult supervision.',
