            ),
          },
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: fr(
            'Can adults use kids SUP boards?',
            'Les adultes peuvent-ils utiliser des planches de paddle enfant ?'
          ),
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: fr(
              'Kids SUPs are designed for lower weight ranges and shorter heights. Adults generally exceed the weight capacity and will find the board unstable and underperforming. Adults should use appropriately sized boards.',
